Package: CyteTypeR
Title: CyteType for R
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nygen Analytics AB", , , "contact@nygen.io", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: R client for 'CyteType', an agentic, evidence-based cell type
    annotation service for single-cell RNA sequencing data. It prepares a
    clustered 'Seurat' object and its marker genes, writes the expression and
    cell metadata files that are uploaded with a job, submits the job to the
    'CyteType' API and adds the results to the object: a cell type label, a
    Cell Ontology term, a cell state and the reviewer's confidence for every
    cluster, together with the evidence behind each label. Every job also
    produces an interactive report. Using the service requires an API key; the
    documentation is at <https://docs.nygen.io/CyteType/>.
